    <string name="changelog_title">What is new</string>
    <string name="changelog">What is new (5.7.1):

→ AMBIENT SOUND FIXED
• Gain adjusted per mode: wind, storm and fire were clipping (hissing distortion); now each sound is clean
• Birds and forest: the chirp used to come out as hiss — the chirp phase is now computed correctly and the tone finally comes through
• The thunder in "Rain and thunder" is now deep and present (before it barely showed up)
• Noise floor reduced in rain, fire and birds — background hiss cut down</string>
